    "title": "Albany PD seeking to identify 2 in ongoing investigation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Courtney Ward ,\n3 hours ago\nALBANY, N.Y. ( NEWS10 ) — The Albany Police Department is asking for the public’s help in identifying two people as part of an ongoing homicide investigation.\nGet the latest news, weather, sports and entertainment delivered right to your inbox! Police said the homicide took place on June 16.\nAnyone with information on the identity of either person is asked to call police at (518) 466-1585. Anonymous tips may also be left with Capital Region Crime Stoppers .\nRead the latest from NEWS10:\nNEWS10 is the Capital Region’s local news leader!\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to NEWS10 ABC.\n1",
